{
  "message": "You can notify us that you’ll be traveling in two ways: 1) Use the Rho-Bank mobile app or online banking: open your Platinum Rewards Card details and look for “travel notifications,” “travel alerts,” or a “manage card” / travel-setting option to add your trip (dates + destination countries). 2) Contact us — call 1-800-RHO-BANK (or send a secure message from the app/website) and ask an agent to add a travel notice.\n\nWhat to include when you add the notice: which card(s) (Platinum Rewards Card), travel dates (start and return), and destination country(ies) (Japan). If you’d like, I can add the travel notice for you — I would need to verify your identity first (we’ll confirm two of: date of birth, email, phone, or address). Would you like me to set this up for you now?"
}

{
  "message": "Glad that helped — answers below.

1) Lead time: I could not find any KB rule that requires a specific lead time for travel notices. As a practical matter, set the notice as soon as you book travel; a week ahead is perfectly fine. If you need to change dates later you can update the notice in the app or by contacting support.

2) App location: The knowledge base does not list an exact menu label. In most Rho-Bank apps the travel notice lives in the card settings (look for Manage Card, Card Settings, or Security/Alerts) and is labeled Travel notifications or Travel alerts. If you don’t see it, try searching the app for “travel” or “notifications,” or send a secure message / call 1-800-RHO-BANK and an agent can add it for you.

Would you like brief step‑by‑step instructions for the mobile app or the website?"
}
